#: copr.cpp:48
msgid "Copr hub (the web-UI/API server) hostname"
msgstr "Copr centrmezgla (tīmekļa saskarnes/API servera) resursdatora nosaukums"

#: copr.cpp:88
#, c++-format
msgid ""
"Copr project ID to {}.  Use either a format OWNER/PROJECT or HUB/OWNER/"
"PROJECT (if HUB is not specified, the default one, or --hub <ARG>, is used.  "
"OWNER is either a username, or a @groupname.  PROJECT can be a simple "
"project name, or a \"project directory\" containing colons, e.g. "
"'project:custom:123'.  HUB can be either the Copr frontend hostname (e.g. "
"copr.fedorainfracloud.org ) or the shortcut (e.g. fedora).  Example: 'fedora/"
"@footeam/coolproject'."
msgstr ""
"Copr projekta ID, ko {}. Lietojiet formātu OWNER/PROJECT vai HUB/OWNER/"
"PROJECT (ja HUB nav norādīts, tiek lietots noklusējuma vai --hub <ARG>). "
"OWNER ir lietotājvārds vai @grupas_nosaukums. PROJECT var būt vienkāršs "
"projekta nosaukums vai „projekta direktorija” ar koliem, piemēram, "
"'project:custom:123'. HUB var būt Copr priekšsaskarnes resursdatora "
"nosaukums (piemēram, copr.fedorainfracloud.org) vai saīsne (piemēram, fedora)"
". Piemērs: 'fedora/@footeam/coolproject'."

#: copr.cpp:106
#, c++-format
msgid "Invalid PROJECT_SPEC format '{}'"
msgstr "Nederīgs PROJECT_SPEC formāts „{}”"

#: copr_constants.hpp:27
msgid ""
"Manage Copr repositories (add-ons provided by users/community/third-party)"
msgstr ""
"Pārvaldīt Copr repozitorijus (lietotāju/kopienas/trešo pušu papildinājumus)"

#: copr_constants.hpp:29
msgid ""
"Enabling a Copr repository. Please note that this repository is not part\n"
"of the main distribution, and quality may vary.\n"
"\n"
"The Fedora Project does not exercise any power over the contents of\n"
"this repository beyond the rules outlined in the Copr FAQ at\n"
"<https://docs.copr.fedorainfracloud.org/user_documentation.html#what-i-can-"
"build-in-copr>,\n"
"and packages are not held to any quality or security level.\n"
"\n"
"Please do not file bug reports about these packages in Fedora\n"
"Bugzilla. In case of problems, contact the owner of this repository.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tiek iespējots Copr repozitorijs. Ņemiet vērā, ka šis repozitorijs nav\n"
"galvenās distribūcijas daļa, un kvalitāte var atšķirties.\n"
"\n"
"Fedora projekts nekādi neietekmē šī repozitorija saturu, izņemot\n"
"Copr BUJ izklāstītās kārtulas\n"
"<https://docs.copr.fedorainfracloud.org/user_documentation.html#what-i-can-"
"build-in-copr>,\n"
"un pakotnēm netiek garantēts nekāds kvalitātes vai drošības līmenis.\n"
"\n"
"Neziņojiet par kļūdām šajās pakotnēs Fedora Bugzilla.\n"
"Problēmu gadījumā sazinieties ar šī repozitorija īpašnieku.\n"

#: copr_constants.hpp:41
#, c++-format
msgid ""
"Maintainer of the enabled Copr repository decided to make\n"
"it dependent on other repositories. Such repositories are\n"
"usually necessary for successful installation of RPMs from\n"
"the main Copr repository (they provide runtime dependencies).\n"
"\n"
"Be aware that the note about quality and bug-reporting\n"
"above applies here too, Fedora Project doesn't control the\n"
"content. Please review the list:\n"
"\n"
"{}\n"
"These repositories are being enabled together with the main\n"
"repository.\n"
msgstr ""
"Iespējotā Copr repozitorija uzturētājs ir nolēmis padarīt\n"
"to atkarīgu no citiem repozitorijiem. Šādi repozitoriji parasti\n"
"ir nepieciešami, lai veiksmīgi instalētu RPM no galvenā\n"
"Copr repozitorija (tie nodrošina izpildlaika atkarības).\n"
"\n"
"Ņemiet vērā, ka iepriekš minētā piezīme par kvalitāti un ziņošanu\n"
"par kļūdām attiecas arī uz tiem — Fedora projekts nekontrolē\n"
"to saturu. Pārskatiet sarakstu:\n"
"\n"
"{}\n"
"Šie repozitoriji tiek iespējoti kopā ar galveno\n"
"repozitoriju.\n"

#: copr_debug.cpp:30
msgid "print useful info about the system, useful for debugging"
msgstr "drukāt noderīgu informāciju par sistēmu, noderīgu atkļūdošanai"

#: copr_disable.cpp:35
#, c++-format
msgid ""
"disable specified Copr repository (if exists), keep {}/*.repo file - just "
"mark enabled=0"
msgstr ""
"atspējot norādīto Copr repozitoriju (ja eksistē), paturēt {}/*.repo failu — "
"tikai atzīmēt enabled=0"

#: copr_enable.cpp:38
#, c++-format
msgid ""
"download the repository info from a Copr server and install it as a {}/"
"*.repo file"
msgstr ""
"lejupielādēt repozitorija informāciju no Copr servera un instalēt to kā {}/"
"*.repo failu"

#: copr_enable.cpp:46
msgid ""
"Chroot specified in the NAME-RELEASE-ARCH format, e.g. 'fedora-rawhide-"
"ppc64le'.  When not specified, the 'dnf copr' command attempts to detect it."
msgstr ""
"Chroot, norādīts formātā NAME-RELEASE-ARCH, piemēram, 'fedora-rawhide-"
"ppc64le'. Ja nav norādīts, komanda „dnf copr” mēģina to noteikt."

#: copr_list.cpp:53
msgid "list Copr repositories"
msgstr "uzskaitīt Copr repozitorijus"

#: copr_list.cpp:86
msgid ""
"No repositories were loaded from the installroot. To use the configuration "
"and repositories of the host system, pass --use-host-config."
msgstr ""
"No installroot netika ielādēts neviens repozitorijs. Lai lietotu "
"resursdatora sistēmas konfigurāciju un repozitorijus, norādiet --use-host-"
"config."

#: copr_remove.cpp:35
#, c++-format
msgid ""
"remove specified Copr repository from the system (removes the {}/*.repo file)"
msgstr "noņemt norādīto Copr repozitoriju no sistēmas (noņem {}/*.repo failu)"

#: copr_repo.cpp:91
#, c++-format
msgid "Directory '{}' not found in '{}' Copr project."
msgstr "Direktorija „{}” nav atrasta Copr projektā „{}”."

#: copr_repo.cpp:97
msgid "You can use one of these available directories:"
msgstr "Varat lietot kādu no šīm pieejamajām direktorijām:"

#: copr_repo.cpp:113
msgid "Chroot not found in the given Copr project"
msgstr "Norādītajā Copr projektā chroot nav atrasts"

#: copr_repo.cpp:115
msgid "Unable to detect chroot, specify it explicitly."
msgstr "Nevar noteikt chroot, norādiet to tieši."

#: copr_repo.cpp:121
msgid "We tried to find these repos without a success:"
msgstr "Mēģinājām atrast šos repozitorijus, bet nesekmīgi:"

#: copr_repo.cpp:126
msgid "You can choose one of the available chroots explicitly:"
msgstr "Varat tieši izvēlēties kādu no pieejamajiem chroot:"

#: copr_repo.cpp:200
msgid "Can't parse Copr repo spec: "
msgstr "Nevar parsēt Copr repozitorija specifikāciju: "

#: copr_repo.cpp:344
#, c++-format
msgid "Can't remove the {} repo file"
msgstr "Nevar noņemt {} repozitorija failu"

#: copr_repo.cpp:347
#, c++-format
msgid "Repo file {} successfully removed"
msgstr "Repozitorija fails {} veiksmīgi noņemts"

#: copr_repo.cpp:393
#, c++-format
msgid "Can't find item {} in {}"
msgstr "Nevar atrast vienumu {} (meklēts: {})"

#: copr_repo.cpp:449
#, c++-format
msgid "Removing old config file '{}'"
msgstr "Noņem veco konfigurācijas failu „{}”"

#: copr_repo.cpp:452
msgid "Can't remove"
msgstr "Nevar noņemt"

#: copr_repo.cpp:526
#, c++-format
msgid ""
"Copr repofile '{}' has an old format, fix by re-enabling it $ {} copr enable "
"{}"
msgstr ""
"Copr repozitorija failam „{}” ir vecs formāts, salabojiet, to atkārtoti "
"iespējojot: $ {} copr enable {}"

#: copr_repo.cpp:560
#, c++-format
msgid "Repo id '{}' in '{}' is suspicious"
msgstr "Repozitorija id „{}” failā „{}” ir aizdomīgs"

#: copr_repo.cpp:567
#, c++-format
msgid "Repo id '{}' doesn't belong to '{}' repofile"
msgstr "Repozitorija id „{}” nepieder repozitorija failam „{}”"

#: copr_repo.cpp:618
#, c++-format
msgid "Copr repository '{}' in '{}' disabled."
msgstr "Copr repozitorijs „{}” failā „{}” atspējots."

#: copr_repo.cpp:632 copr_repo.cpp:657
#, c++-format
msgid "Repository '{}' not found on this system"
msgstr "Repozitorijs „{}” šajā sistēmā nav atrasts"
